The pure PyTorch resampler and Kaldi mel-bank dependency closure derive from
TorchAudio 2.7.1, pytorch/audio revision
95c61b4168fc5133be8dd8c1337d929d066ae6cf, copyright (c) 2017
Facebook Inc. (Soumith Chintala), BSD-2-Clause. Its full license is retained
in docs/TORCHAUDIO_LICENSE and included in the wheel.

The small pure Torch ConvNormActivation compatibility wrapper follows the
TorchVision 0.22.1 constructor and module-index contract. TorchVision is
BSD-3-Clause; its full license is retained in docs/TORCHVISION_LICENSE and
included in the wheel. The binary TorchVision runtime is not a dependency.

The 527-label AudioSet class CSV is included as a small vocabulary asset.
AudioSet ontology is CC BY-SA 4.0; dataset is CC BY 4.0. Model weights are not
bundled. Their license is not separately stated in the upstream release.
This is an independent package, not an official EfficientAT release.
